==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[blood-thirsty]]
* {{qualifier|obsolete}} [[bloudthirsty]], [[bloud-thirsty]]

===Etymology===
From {{compound|blood|thirsty|lang=en}}. Compare {{etyl|nl|-}} {{m|nl|bloeddorstig||bloodthirsty}}, {{etyl|de|-}} {{m|de|blutdürstig||bloodthirsty}}, {{etyl|da|-}} {{m|da|blodtørstig||bloodthirsty}}, {{etyl|sv|-}} {{m|sv|blodtörstig||bloodthristy}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|er|more}}

# [[thirsty|Thirsty]] for [[blood]]: [[inexorably]] [[violent]] or [[eager]] for [[bloodshed]], [[murderous]].

====Derived terms====
* {{sense|noun, state}} [[bloodthirst]]
* {{sense|noun, feeling}} [[bloodthirstiness]]
* {{sense|noun, agent}} [[bloodthirster]]
* {{sense|adjective, in this state}} [[blood-thirsting]]

